        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Choose a number of fingers from one to five. Each choice is a different effect, and each costs the same single Reiatsu Point.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Fingers</th><th>Effect</th></tr><tr><td><strong>One</strong></td><td>Range 60 ft., one creature. Ranged spell attack, <strong>3d6</strong> fire, doubled on a crit.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Two</strong></td><td>Range 60 ft., <strong>two</strong> creatures. As One, but <strong>2d6</strong> each.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Three</strong></td><td><strong>30-foot line</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>2d6</strong> fire.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Four</strong></td><td>A blade of fire with an elongated crossguard forms around your hand and you slash. <strong>15-foot emanation</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>2d6</strong> fire; creatures that fail take 1d4 persistent fire.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Five</strong></td><td><strong>30-foot cone</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>2d6</strong> fire; the ground becomes difficult terrain until the start of your next turn.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><strong>Refined (9th) &mdash; Deeper Burn.</strong> All five options gain their next increment early (treat your rank as one higher for Burner Finger only), and <strong>Five</strong> additionally leaves the difficult terrain <em>burning</em> until the end of your next turn, dealing 2d6 fire to a creature that enters or ends its turn there.</p><hr /><p><em>No option is better than another at every moment, which is the whole design.</em></p>"
        },
